+- **Pass 3a:** Opened only lines 1-276 of `specs/stories/rcv-3a-rules-explanation-disciplines-rites.md`, covering Story, Design source, Acceptance Criteria, What this story is NOT, Tasks/Subtasks, Dev Notes, expected File List, and References. I did not read the remaining lines before freezing Pass 3a.
+- **Pass 3b:** Opened the story's remaining lines 277-291. They are only the end of References; the file has no Dev Agent Record or Senior Developer Review. Also opened the relevant portions of `server/tests/gdx-6-structured-power-costs.test.js` to diagnose its gate failure, plus this findings file for final assembly. I did not open either sibling review artifact (`rcv-3a-codex-review.md` or `rcv-3a-codex-run.log`).
