+- Bounded five-file gate excluding that DB-coupled file — **5/5 files passed; 139 passed, 22 skipped (161 total)** in 14.0s.
+- Read of `gdx-6-structured-power-costs.test.js` lines 1-51 and 256-321 — succeeded and confirmed its otherwise-pure `fmtCostLine` tests are blocked by file-global DB hooks.
