public\mockups\data\downtime_submissions.json:237:      "sphere_2_description": "The subtle pro-kindred enshittification of Sydney Harbour after dark. (For the Nos 3am vibe baby!!!)The territory will be both better (for all) and worse (for mortals) in a clever way. Events will simultaneously draw people into the Harbour district, but stupid track-works close down public transport just as events let out forcing walks home. Public works for safety that actually break existing lighting. Energy saving initatives means that there is dim-lights but far apart. cost savings. it is almost like the bad ideas are deliberate....",
